Reference implementation: Prerequisite Gate for Financial Operations
Claude Certified Architect (Foundations), Task Statement 1.4

Covers:
  1. Three tool definitions with JSON Schema input_schema
  2. Session-scoped state tracking the verified customer
  3. A dispatcher with prerequisite gates on lookup_order and process_refund
  4. escalate_to_human with all five handoff fields, validated in code
  5. Deterministic tests proving the gate blocks bypass attempts
  6. Live agent runs, including a multi-concern handoff

Run deterministic tests only:   python reference_implementation.py
Run live agent scenarios too:   python reference_implementation.py --live
